
    <p><strong>Post Name:</strong> Gramin Dak Sevak (GDS), BPM, ABPM</p>

    <p><strong>Total Vacancy:</strong> 21,413 Posts</p>

    <p><strong>Qualification:</strong> 10th Pass with Mathematics & English</p>

    <p><strong>Age Limit:</strong> 18 - 40 Years</p>

    <p><strong>Selection Process:</strong> Merit List Based on 10th Marks (No Exam)</p>

    <p><strong>Salary:</strong> ₹12,000 - ₹35,000 Per Month</p>

    <p><strong>Application Mode:</strong> Online</p>

